 "Stopped listening": "Kuyekiwe ukuphulaphula",
 "Voice input is not available in this language on this browser. Try English.": "Ukufaka ngelizwi akufumaneki ngolu lwimi kule bhrawuza. Zama isiNgesi.",
 "No {lang} voice is installed on this device, so an English voice will read instead.": "Akukho lizwi le-{lang} elifakwe kwesi sixhobo, ngoko ilizwi lesiNgesi liza kufunda endaweni yalo.",
 "Please correct the highlighted fields": "Nceda ulungise amabala aqaqanjisiweyo",
